  "objectives": [
    "Identify the four heart chambers (right atrium, right ventricle, left atrium, left ventricle), four valves (tricuspid, pulmonary, mitral/bicuspid, aortic), and major inflow/outflow vessels (SVC, IVC, pulmonary arteries and veins, aorta).",
    "Trace dual-loop circulation in order: systemic return \u2192 right heart \u2192 lungs \u2192 left heart \u2192 systemic output.",
    "Differentiate pulmonary vs systemic circuits and explain how right vs left sides of the heart match their functions.",
    "Explain why the left ventricle has thicker myocardium (greater pressure to perfuse the entire body).",
    "Describe valve function in preventing backflow and identify which valves separate chamber pairs and chamber\u2013vessel connections."
